  era: "c. 1565\u20131648 \xB7 Section 16 \xB7 Mughal Empire \xB7 1526 \u2013 1857"
  title: Mughal architecture
  text: 'Mughal architecture blended Persian, Central Asian and Indian styles: Humayun''s Tomb, Fatehpur Sikri, the Taj Mahal, the Red Fort and the four-part charbagh gardens. Its domes, arches, inlay work, red sandstone and marble are famous worldwide.'
